  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Gorius filius Petri de Goriis locabo et concedo tibi Rainerio filio Iohannis de Rinaldinis officinam meam positam in civitate Senensi, in via Mercatorum, cum fornace, incudibus, malleis et omnibus instrumentis fabrilis artis, pro annuo censu solidorum triginta denariorum Pisanorum, solvendo in kalendis Ianuarii cuiuslibet anni.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc locationem venire temptaverit, componat auri optimi libras sex, et haec carta firma permaneat in perpetuum.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Salimbenus de Salimbenis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Pannocchieschus filius Ugolini</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ugolinus de Pannocchieschis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Enricus filius Petri</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
